cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it."
title: "ecsodus: safe adopt-in-place migration of AWS Copilot CLI applications to Terraform-managed ECS"
abstract: >-
  ecsodus migrates applications deployed with the retired AWS Copilot CLI to Terraform without
  moving traffic. It inventories the Copilot CloudFormation stacks read-only, imports every
  resource in place with literal values so the first Terraform plan is import-only, and emits
  retain patches that put DeletionPolicy and UpdateReplacePolicy Retain on every resource so the
  stacks can be deleted without deleting infrastructure, which neutralises the destructive Delete
  handlers of Copilot's custom resources. Each mutating runbook step is gated by a machine check
  (change-set acceptance rule, import-only and zero-change plan gates, retain verification). The
  design was approved through a three-model review council and verified end to end on AWS.
type: software
